Satelite Internet Access
    - Communication satelites located in space to connect a user to the internet

    Normally used in homes far out in country or far from civilization where their only option is satelite
        - They use dish satelites that points at the sky

    Speed wont be as fast as fiber, microwave link, or even some cable modems
    Expensive
    High Latency

    But recently, Starlink has been creating faster transmission speeds and deploy thousands of satelites
        Latency of 25-30ms instead of 5000ms
        Did this by not using geosynchronus orbits (FAR AS FREAK OUT IN SPACE), but now they came a lot closer (tradeoff is that they cover less of earth)